# Generated Rust and TypeScript - regenerate with `buf generate`
/gen/rust/
/gen/typescript/

# The Go stubs under /gen/go are deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# They are the only copy of the generated gRPC clients in a clean checkout and
# every Go service resolves them through
#   replace github.com/opus-casino/proto => ../../../libs/proto
# so `go build ./...` cannot start without them. They are committed at exactly
# the path `make -C libs/proto gen-go` writes to, so regenerating produces no
# diff.

# Build artifacts
build/